title: Desktopimgdownldr Used to Download a File
id: f90dde15-0a48-4841-853d-8086696c6e5b
status: experimental
description: Detects desktopimgdownldr.exe with a lockscreenurl parameter used to download an arbitrary file, a signed LOLBin ingress-transfer method that abuses the lock-screen image downloader.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1105/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\desktopimgdownldr.exe'
    CommandLine|contains: 'lockscreenurl'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - None expected
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1105
